  "posts": [
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T17:36Z",
    "text": "That's a wrap on Day 1 of #WebSummit 2026 🇵🇹",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxy4lxhit2j",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T16:00Z",
    "text": "Who's ready for Night Summit? 🤩",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxsrisvg32n",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T15:00Z",
    "text": "\"In Europe, it's very important for our citizens that they can trust these technologies.\" 🇪🇺\n\nHenna Virkkunen of the European Commission spoke at #WebSummit about balancing innovation with the protection of citizens.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxpgei2al2j",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T14:01Z",
    "text": "Did you know AI is now helping us skip animal trials in medicine? 🧬\n\nRichard Socher took the #WebSummit stage to share how Parallel Bio’s AI-generated organoids have been FDA-approved to test drug toxicity without using animals. It's a beautiful example of how AI can save lives.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxm3edvh72r",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T13:11Z",
    "text": "The numbers are in for #WebSummit 2026 🥳\n\nWeb Summit opened on Monday, November 9, drawing 70,003 attendees, 3,052 exhibiting companies, and 1,943 investors.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxjdahrof2w",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T12:00Z",
    "text": "Will AI agents become your next target audience? 🤖💼\n\nAt #WebSummit, Anton Osika of Lovable breaks down how AI agents will soon make buying decisions for their \"human overlords,\" and why human storytelling will still be the key to making a sale.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzxfdt5itp2z",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-10T09:00Z",
    "text": "Olá, Lisboa 🇵🇹 Welcome to day one of #WebSummit!",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzx3bgmitm2z",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-09T20:30Z",
    "text": "#WebSummit is officially live! 🇵🇹\n\nSee you all tomorrow for Day 1.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzvrdzhxos2k",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-09T19:30Z",
    "text": "\"Difference and diversity is the mother of innovation.\"\n\nSpeaking on stage at #WebSummit, Mayor of Lisbon Carlos Moedas reminds us that the solution to our biggest challenges often comes from connecting with those who see the world completely differently.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzvnzetlki2k",
    "match": false
   },
   {
    "at": "2026-11-09T18:56Z",
    "text": "Is the new Silicon Valley in the Global East? 🤔 \n\nWeb Summit CEO & Founder Paddy Cosgrave takes the stage at #WebSummit to share why the next generation of superstars in AI, energy, and robotics are coming out of China, not California.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/websummit.bsky.social/post/3mzvm4xefm42k",
    "match": false
   }
  ]
 },
